Section: misc
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://github.com/h3nc4/Dreamweaver
Description: Dreamweaver wallpaper and boot menu background
 Installs the Dreamweaver wallpaper under /usr/share/backgrounds/dreamweaver and
 the GRUB background under /usr/share/images/dreamweaver, with a copy in
 /boot/grub where GRUB can read it before an encrypted root is unlocked.
